All of the inlined images will have two distinct benefits:
• Total bytes are reduced via Gzip to 1–3% less than even the original total bytes.
• Images will avoid being manipulated by intermediate proxies that can recom‐
press images and distort images for mobile users (we will discuss this in Chap‐
